  "bodyHtml": "<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Structured output, so it can be used as code, composable.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Usage</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ curl -s https://acme.com/pricing | \\\n  npx ai &quot;extract pricing tiers&quot; --schema '{\n    &quot;tiers&quot;: [{\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,\n      &quot;price&quot;: &quot;number&quot;,\n      &quot;bandwidth_gb&quot;: &quot;number&quot;,\n      &quot;team_members&quot;: &quot;number&quot;\n    }]\n  }'\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">$ curl -s https://acme.com/pricing <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> \\\n  npx ai <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>extract pricing tiers<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> --schema <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    \"tiers\": [{</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">      \"name\": \"string\",</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">      \"price\": \"number\",</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">      \"bandwidth_gb\": \"number\",</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">      \"team_members\": \"number\"</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    }]</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">  }<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Output:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;tiers&quot;: [\n    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Starter&quot;, &quot;price&quot;: 0, &quot;bandwidth_gb&quot;: 50, &quot;team_members&quot;: 1},\n    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Growth&quot;, &quot;price&quot;: 29, &quot;bandwidth_gb&quot;: 500, &quot;team_members&quot;: 5},\n    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Scale&quot;, &quot;price&quot;: 99, &quot;bandwidth_gb&quot;: 2000, &quot;team_members&quot;: 20},\n    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Enterprise&quot;, &quot;price&quot;: -1, &quot;bandwidth_gb&quot;: -1, &quot;team_members&quot;: -1}\n  ]\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"tiers\"</span>: [\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Starter<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"price\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"bandwidth_gb\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">50</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"team_members\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>},\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Growth<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"price\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">29</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"bandwidth_gb\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">500</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"team_members\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">5</span>},\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Scale<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"price\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">99</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"bandwidth_gb\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">2000</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"team_members\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">20</span>},\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Enterprise<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"price\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">-1</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"bandwidth_gb\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">-1</span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"team_members\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">-1</span>}\n  ]\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Advanced usage</strong> – solving harder problems with AI as an API blackbox</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ex: Installing the latest version of a github release is trickier than it may seem, but it could become something like:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"#!/bin/bash\n# install-latest.sh - Install any GitHub CLI tool with one command\n\nREPO=$1  # e.g., &quot;junegunn/fzf&quot;\n\n# Get latest release data\ncurl -s &quot;https://api.github.com/repos/$REPO/releases/latest&quot; | \\\n  npx ai &quot;find download URL for $(uname -s) $(uname -m)&quot; --schema '{\n    &quot;download_url&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,\n    &quot;binary_name&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,\n    &quot;extract_command&quot;: &quot;string&quot;\n  }' &gt; release.json\n\n# Extract the info\nURL=$(jq -r .download_url release.json)\nBINARY=$(jq -r .binary_name release.json)\nEXTRACT=$(jq -r .extract_command release.json)\n\n# Download and install\ncurl -L &quot;$URL&quot; -o /tmp/download\neval &quot;$EXTRACT” # 🤠\nchmod +x &quot;$BINARY&quot;\nsudo mv &quot;$BINARY&quot; /usr/local/bin/\n\necho &quot;✓ Installed $BINARY”\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#!</span>/bin/bash</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> install-latest.sh - Install any GitHub CLI tool with one command</span>\n\nREPO=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$1</span>  <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> e.g., \"junegunn/fzf\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Get latest release data</span>\ncurl -s <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://api.github.com/repos/<span class=\"pl-smi\">$REPO</span>/releases/latest<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> \\\n  npx ai <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>find download URL for <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">$(</span>uname -s<span class=\"pl-pds\">)</span></span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">$(</span>uname -m<span class=\"pl-pds\">)</span></span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> --schema <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    \"download_url\": \"string\",</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    \"binary_name\": \"string\",</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    \"extract_command\": \"string\"</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">  }<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> <span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span> release.json\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Extract the info</span>\nURL=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">$(</span>jq -r .download_url release.json<span class=\"pl-pds\">)</span></span>\nBINARY=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">$(</span>jq -r .binary_name release.json<span class=\"pl-pds\">)</span></span>\nEXTRACT=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">$(</span>jq -r .extract_command release.json<span class=\"pl-pds\">)</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Download and install</span>\ncurl -L <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">$URL</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> -o /tmp/download\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">eval</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">$EXTRACT</span>” # 🤠</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">chmod +x <span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span><span class=\"pl-smi\">$BINARY</span><span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">sudo mv <span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span><span class=\"pl-smi\">$BINARY</span><span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> /usr/local/bin/</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"></span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">echo <span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>✓ Installed <span class=\"pl-smi\">$BINARY</span>”</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Usage</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Install fzf (handles .tar.gz)\n$ ./install-latest.sh junegunn/fzf\n✓ Installed fzf\n\n# Install ripgrep (handles different naming: rg)\n$ ./install-latest.sh BurntSushi/ripgrep  \n✓ Installed rg\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Install fzf (handles .tar.gz)</span>\n$ ./install-latest.sh junegunn/fzf\n✓ Installed fzf\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Install ripgrep (handles different naming: rg)</span>\n$ ./install-latest.sh BurntSushi/ripgrep  \n✓ Installed rg</pre></div>",
